Package: Rjif
Title: The 'Jif' Statement: Judgment-Based Control Flow via TypeSafe Jev
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Yue", "Shentu", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "n43368410@gmail.com")
Description: Replaces hard-coded 'if' conditions with calibrated semantic
    decisions. Wraps the TypeSafe Jev 'System One' API (Choice, Score and Noul
    primitives) and provides jif()/jmatch() control-flow verbs plus a
    vectorized evaluator that scores whole vectors of narratives (for example
    eCRF adverse-event text) one state per API call, with calibrated
    confidence, explicit abstention sentinels and selection-failure analytics
    for auditing reliability.
